  "body": "Once in a generation opportunity.\r\n\r\nAfter 73 years of continuous family ownership, this exclusive site is being offered to the market for the first time.\r\n\r\nThe current vendors grew up in this home, built in 1953, and now it's your turn to write the next chapter.\r\n\r\nPerched high above the water, this remarkable 1,345 sq m (more or less), clifftop site offers a lifestyle most only dream of.\r\n\r\nWake up to the view. Sweeping outlooks stretch across Half Moon Bay Marina and Bucklands Beach, with ever-changing light, sparkling water, and boats gliding by below. Whether it's a sunrise coffee or an evening drink, every day here is a front-row seat to the coast.\r\n\r\nYour own path to the beach. Shared private beach access means the water is yours to enjoy. Swim, paddle, launch a kayak, or simply swing under the Pohutukawa tree, away from the crowds.\r\n\r\nRenovate, rebuild or reimagine. The original 1953 home is full of character and memories, but it's the land and the position that make this opportunity so rare.\r\n\r\nPositions like this are held for generations and seldom released. Don't miss your chance to secure one of the area's most exceptional sites.\r\n\r\nContact me today to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nImportant: This property may be marketed as suitable for overseas purchasers. However, this does not constitute confirmation of eligibility, approval, or suitability for any individual buyer. All overseas purchasers remain subject to New Zealand’s overseas investment laws, including the Overseas Investment Act 2005, and may require consent from the Overseas Investment Office. You must obtain your own independent legal, financial, and technical advice and secure any necessary approvals before proceeding with a purchase.",
